> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234430-soldier-the-valorous-army-men-themed-new-wod-cofd-fan-game?p=1234994#post1234994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The main roadblock to being serious if going for astic toys would be the total inabilitt to talk to normal humans as equals. Youre going to need to solve that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Indeed I will. I need to do some thinking on this","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T12:05:44-07:00","id":1235038,"title":"","content":"Why is their energy called Chakra?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T13:39:08-07:00","id":1235074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234430-soldier-the-valorous-army-men-themed-new-wod-cofd-fan-game?p=1235038#post1235038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is their energy called Chakra?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's a working name, I needed a title that wasn't already taken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T20:17:59-07:00","id":1235158,"title":"","content":"Maybe make the magic name nationalism? Like their love for whatever they defend is so big it's made manifest","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T20:19:59-07:00","id":1235159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234430-soldier-the-valorous-army-men-themed-new-wod-cofd-fan-game?p=1235158#post1235158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe make the magic name nationalism? Like their love for whatever they defend is so big it's made manifest</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Eh, &quot;nationalism&quot; is a loaded term. Especially these days. Assuming you're not trolling though, I do get the concept behind what you are describing.<br /> <br /> Maybe call it 'Patriotism&quot; or &quot;Valor&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T21:11:49-07:00","id":1235174,"title":"","content":"Yeah either two could work","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-14T21:17:36-07:00","id":1235178,"title":"","content":"While I don't see nationalism as a bad word to use, patriotism or valor works just fine, it not better<br /> <br /> Double post, my bad","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T03:33:54-07:00","id":1235229,"title":"","content":"A thought - would Techinques really be their Powers, as opposed to merits? What are you looking at mechanically?<br /> <br /> (To offer an alternative, what about Equipment/Materiel - special gear they can bring to bear. Fuel might even be Requisition.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T03:38:42-07:00","id":1235231,"title":"","content":"I recall something about Furies; a half-formed splat idea by... David Hill, was it? They were something like avenging angels conscripted by some cosmic force of Justice, IIRC. Maybe there\u2019s something to look for there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-18T00:42:14-07:00","id":1236330,"title":"","content":"Some word ideas:<br /> <br /> Change Techniques into Doctrines. Warfare and soldiering and leading of troops is all about the ideas of the combat you're enacting. Technique is if you're trying to do something on a personal level. Doctrine, works better because it defines or embodies not only tactics, but means of doing things.<br /> <br /> For instance: Grand Battleplan, Mass Assault, Air Power. Fleet in Being. No Retreat. Rapid Deployment. Total Warfare. These all represent the names of different combat doctrines, all within our real world in fact.<br /> <br /> Instead of using a traditional energy system, I would argue something like a morale system might be better, representing the ability to change and accelerate your Doctrine useage depending on where you are on the spectrum. Morale is the thing a soldier NEEDS, without which he is nothing.<br /> <br /> <br /> An alternative might be a mana system based on a resource that rarely exhausts. Essentially, your Doctrines are passive buffs to you, but you have to keep spending your mana on maintaining said doctrines to keep them in effect. Sure, there's a couple Doctrines that give you certain &quot;spells&quot; or abilities, but maybe said abilities deplete this very valuable resource that isn't normally spent. I would call this a Focus system, where doctrines are maintained by maintaining your Focus. Expending on powerful Doctrinal abilities would drain a small amount of Focus that wouldn't replenish all too easily, which makes combat a question of whether or not you want to burn your focus for later.<br /> You can say have at Focus 1, Rapid Deployment active, which say gives you better speed and evasion. Or you can choose to go for Grand Battleplan instead to maximize your allies damage for the turn. Or if you had Focus 2, you can Maintain both. But if you want to use Mass Assault which does a massive wallop of damage as you and your allies get a free attack essentially, you need to drop your Focus to 0 temporarily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":7015,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","user":"Almarck","date":". 07-18-2018, 03:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-18T07:15:01-07:00","id":1236395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1234430-soldier-the-valorous-army-men-themed-new-wod-cofd-fan-game?p=1236330#post1236330\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some word ideas:<br /> <br /> Change Techniques into Doctrines. Warfare and soldiering and leading of troops is all about the ideas of the combat you're enacting. Technique is if you're trying to do something on a personal level. Doctrine, works better because it defines or embodies not only tactics, but means of doing things.<br /> <br /> For instance: Grand Battleplan, Mass Assault, Air Power. Fleet in Being. No Retreat. Rapid Deployment. Total Warfare. These all represent the names of different combat doctrines, all within our real world in fact.<br /> <br /> Instead of using a traditional energy system, I would argue something like a morale system might be better, representing the ability to change and accelerate your Doctrine useage depending on where you are on the spectrum. Morale is the thing a soldier NEEDS, without which he is nothing.<br /> <br /> <br /> An alternative might be a mana system based on a resource that rarely exhausts. Essentially, your Doctrines are passive buffs to you, but you have to keep spending your mana on maintaining said doctrines to keep them in effect. Sure, there's a couple Doctrines that give you certain &quot;spells&quot; or abilities, but maybe said abilities deplete this very valuable resource that isn't normally spent. I would call this a Focus system, where doctrines are maintained by maintaining your Focus. Expending on powerful Doctrinal abilities would drain a small amount of Focus that wouldn't replenish all too easily, which makes combat a question of whether or not you want to burn your focus for later.<br /> You can say have at Focus 1, Rapid Deployment active, which say gives you better speed and evasion. Or you can choose to go for Grand Battleplan instead to maximize your allies damage for the turn. Or if you had Focus 2, you can Maintain both. But if you want to use Mass Assault which does a massive wallop of damage as you and your allies get a free attack essentially, you need to drop your Focus to 0 temporarily.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like the way you think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-21T06:23:07-07:00","id":1237471,"title":"","content":"If you want to go the more Toy route. &quot;The Nutcracker&quot; would be a good thing to look at.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24179-grimmi05","name":"Grimmi05","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}